<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh taka ends unchanged against dollar.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh taka ends unchanged against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh taka closed unchanged at 42.5460/5500 to the dollar in interbank trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>The taka quoted at 42.5450/5500 in early trading. The local unit remained mostly steady despite demand for dollars because the rates quoted were within the central bank band of 42.35/55.</p>
<p>The interbank call money rates also ended flat at 4.0 percent to 4.75 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
</text>
